{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quase Rosa features basic mechanics: <strong>double jump</strong>, <strong>dash</strong> and <strong>ston</strong>e. However, each time you try to pass a level, only one different skill is possible. In other words, if you die or restart the level, you'll have a 33% chance of picking up any of the three skills at random, which may or may not make it easier to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a system of <strong>Percentage Cards</strong>, where you can increase the probability of playing with a desired skill. The player can choose between 50%, 75% and 100% cards and then select which skill they want to use the card for.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Temperatures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/138ef4cdae5b0628118fcc7a561dc735608173ed.jpg"},{"name":"Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/edf396830f9a3f03c34aad06ac8fdad40c3d56b8.jpg"},{"name":"Altitudes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/b18e98929629ee87b5efe424a512c71600c21bbf.jpg"},{"name":"Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/edc3e93be0e115e3784bdadf25d4820630b2549d.jpg"},{"name":"Insanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/e22d4c6b963cfece11e31a9b5c1d9b20097b02de.jpg"},{"name":"UNSTOPPABLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861820/c2aae6f3cdf8844d401c65c1df72284a5fcede86.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861820?t=1763598125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861820/a1e644eb62217024d26e9871e9a3b18f0aa98874/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763598125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat